        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Storyteller</strong> is a multiplayer investigation game for up to 5 players, where one takes on the role of the narrator — the <i>Storyteller</i> — and the other four become investigators tasked with uncovering mysterious cases. Set in a suspenseful universe with a humorous twist, the game presents intriguing stories that lead to unpredictable, often comical endings, featuring unique and exaggerated characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who prefer to play solo, <strong>The Storyteller</strong> also offers a single-player mode: you step into the role of an investigator and interact in real time with an AI narrator that tells the story and responds to your voice input, delivering an immersive and dynamic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery, deduction, and laughter come together in a game where nothing is quite what it seems — and the solution might be as absurd as it is brilliant.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Storyteller</strong> is a multiplayer investigation game for up to 5 players, where one takes on the role of the narrator — the <i>Storyteller</i> — and the other four become investigators tasked with uncovering mysterious cases. Set in a suspenseful universe with a humorous twist, the game presents intriguing stories that lead to unpredictable, often comical endings, featuring unique and exaggerated characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who prefer to play solo, <strong>The Storyteller</strong> also offers a single-player mode: you step into the role of an investigator and interact in real time with an AI narrator that tells the story and responds to your voice input, delivering an immersive and dynamic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery, deduction, and laughter come together in a game where nothing is quite what it seems — and the solution might be as absurd as it is brilliant.</p>",
        "short_description": "The Storyteller is an indie game developed by a single person, where one player becomes the storyteller narrating mysterious tales, while others attempt to unravel unexpected solutions. A multiplayer experience blending suspense and questionable humor.",
